Some new items to consider:

--books--
Shown as item (appearance)

colouring book (plain storybook)
-if your INT is 6 or below, reading it will exercise wisdom.
--"You find the squiggly lines very interesting."
-if you have a marker in your inventory, you can write on the book to
increase your wisdom by 1.
--"You colour in the book!"
-if your INT is above 6, reading it will abuse wisdom.
--"Your mind is dulled by scrutinizing the meaningless lines."
-reading it more than once will have no effect.
--"You find nothing new."
-can only be coloured once. (reading does not affect this)
-if coloured, it becomes a storybook that can be read again.

picture book (pretty storybook)
-if your INT is 6 or below, reading it will increase intelligence by 1.
--"You have fun reading the story!"
-if your INT is 6 or above, reading it will decrease intelligence by 1.
--"Your mind becomes totally absorbed in the children's book."
-reading it more than once will have no effect.

magic storybook (pretty storybook)
-when read, will exercise wisdom and open a branch portal (same as the
Eye of the Aethopica).
--"The book takes you to a distant land!"
-after use, will become a regular picture book.

The following books' appearances are chosen from this list:
spiral-bound book, filthy book, notebook, coverless book, expensive
book, paperback book

cookbook
-when read as blessed, grants you food appraisal.
--"After reading the recipes, your nose begins to tingle."
-when read as cursed, increases hunger. Cursed books can be read
repeatedly.
--"Your mouth waters as you read the recipes."
-when read as uncursed, either one of the effects.

novel
-if your INT is 8 or above, exercises intelligence and wisdom.
--"You read an exciting story!"
-if your INT is below 8, confuses you. Book is not identified.
--"The mystic runes were just too much to comprehend."
-if read as cursed, abuses intelligence and wisdom.
--"What a dull story!"
-Reading more than once will have no effect.
--"You find nothing new."

chemistry textbook
-if your INT is 10 or above, increases intelligence by 1.
--"You delve into the subject of chemistry."
-if your INT is below 10, or book is cursed, confuses you. Book is not
identified.
--"The mystic runes were just too much to comprehend."
-there is a chance that potions in your inventory will be identified.
--"You suddenly realize what [potion] is!"
-reading more than once will have no effect.
--"You find nothing new."

biology textbook
-if your INT is 12 or above, increases intelligence by 1.
--"You delve into the subject of biology."
-if your INT is below 12, or book is cursed, confuses you. Book is not
identified.
--"The mystic runes were just too much to comprehend."
-You gain one-time use polymorph control.
--"You feel an appreciation for the dungeon's biodiversity."
-reading more than once will have no effect.
--"You find nothing new."

physics textbook
-if your INT is 12 or above, increases intelligence by 1.
--"You delve into the subject of physics."
-if your INT is below 12, or book is cursed, confuses you. Book is not
identified.
--"The mystic runes were just too much to comprehend."
-You gain one-time use teleport control.
--"You gain a grasp on quantum mechanics."
-reading more than once will have no effect.
--"You find nothing new."

psychology textbook
-if your INT is 14 or above, increases intelligence and wisdom by 1.
--"You delve into the subject of psychology."
-if your INT is below 14, or book is cursed, confuses you. Book is not
identified.
--"The mystic runes were just too much to comprehend."
-You gain 1-3 points of charisma.
--"You feel that you can communicate more easily."
-reading more than once will have no effect.
--"You find nothing new."

--tools--

laptop (portable computer)
-generated with 10-20 charges.
-coveted by intelligent creatures.
-has a base price of 2000 in shops.
-all stores have a 10% chance of being a Wi-Fi hotspot; the lighting
shop is always one.
-when used in a hotspot, has a chance of acting as a scroll of
identify, or exercises INT or WIS.
--"You surf the web!" (If polymorphed into a giant spider, "You surf
the web, as usual.")
-when used as blessed, extends hotspot range.
-when outside of hotspots, grants messages:
--blessed or uncursed:
--"You begin playing NetHack. -more-"
--cursed:
--"The computer doesn't boot up!" (3/5)
--"You begin to boot up Windows..." (2/5)
---If above option is chosen, you are frozen for n25 turns, then one of
the following is granted:
--"You can't seem to compile NetHack!" (2/5)
--"You get a blue screen of death!" (2/5)
--Wisdom is abused. (1/5)
-Each time you use the computer, a charge is used up.
--If computer is out of charges or cancelled, "The laptop is out of
batteries!"
--If hit by a lightning attack, there is a small chance of recharging
the laptop.

pair of sunglasses (pair of lenses)
-prevents light-based blinding. (100% when blessed, 50% when uncursed,
0% when cursed)
--"The dungeon seems darker now." (unblind, non-dark room)
--"You feel like Elvis!" (unblind, non-dark room, hallucinating)
--Otherwise, no message.

dragon tooth
-engraves as an edged weapon.
-will resist dulling if fixed as a weapon.
-not considered a weapon-tool.

